{"kind":"finding","id":"F-legacy-bugfix-008-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/MilestoneRewardCaptureTests.cs","line":71,"method":"BuildMilestoneDetail_ZeroRewards_ParsesToZero","category":"T1","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/GameStateEventConverter.cs:931; delete the ExtractDetail/TryParse blocks -> stays green because the awarded fields default to 0f; no production change makes it -> red","what_it_asserts":"a zero-reward detail string converts to an action with zero funds and zero rep","why_weak":"every failure mode of the parse (missing key, unparsable token, removed block) also yields 0f, so the assertion cannot distinguish parsed-zero from never-parsed","proposed_action":"delete it, or strengthen it into a negative case that a MALFORMED detail (funds=abc, or detail=null) still converts without throwing and leaves the fields at zero, which the current parse does branch on","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
